heir competency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A5uvuewv1OkQ7kNvwEjcllw&_nc_oc=Adrz2VsV-goId3Yq8qkd2VCLnBu6FTwAVNdqfCP437NStL6CkTqlglW7Odx-HlSZD8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8I0fiPMWeLBauQVGmAbK4Nk0UVJLPZKP9m4Qs5F2yQWA&oe=6A393939"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AHUTwpzpPakQ7kNvwGJQkgT&_nc_oc=AdqLru4BXgG0l85QG6DKkfbMELmipJVJBHelKp-2xzcE_swB1a369Q__GYl6Ug-wPtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-A4wD2sU6Vl1VkbnnQ8DJdS7o13dH07EOkvOaiUjUDEQ&oe=6A395FCF"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BDgfr1NAbQcQ7kNvwFNEtI_&_nc_oc=Ado_-ZSTisj7q_YHzTXL2dEhYSlKFT71RO9vWCd8K6PZvVVimsAzTCXLcC1RGXRiRTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8VW8xjqx6UhK_OGjKbirMnIRF2-cqr1Cx1YmyqZM0SdQ&oe=6A39356E"}, {"file_name": "